Paper Pop-up Book — "The Little Sprite's Adventure" (Pip's Paper Adventure) · asset credits
==========================================================================================

All characters, pop-up sets, page art, the book cover and the story are original and drawn in code
(art.js / sets.js / book.js, Canvas2D + three.js). All sound effects and ambience are synthesized in mix.py.

